<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK PROFIT 25 MILLION KROONS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK PROFIT 25 MILLION KROONS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's central bank said on Monday that it made a profit in May of 25 million kroons.  </p>
<p>&quot;The profit is not shown as a seperate item in the bank's balance sheet, but is combined with capital and reserves&quot;, Kaja Kell of the central bank's information department told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The changes include fluxations in any number of items under this category,&quot; she added.</p>
<p>In May, the central bank's capital, reserves and profit/loss was 1.484 billion kroons, ten million kroons lower than April's 1.494 billion kroons.</p>
<p>--David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
